# Exceptions

# Normative Modeling: Allow images and excel/csv
!Normative Modeling/**/*.xlsx
!Normative Modeling/**/*.xls
!Normative Modeling/**/*.csv
!Normative Modeling/**/*.png
!Normative Modeling/**/*.jpg
!Normative Modeling/**/*.jpeg
!Normative Modeling/**/*.pdf

# BrainAge-Prediction: Allow pickle models
!BrainAge-Prediction/**/*.pkl
